WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:11.802
Hi! Cat, dog, apple: which isn't an animal? Grouping words helps you remember them. Today we'll sort words into groups.

2
00:00:11.952 --> 00:00:16.218
Animals: cat, dog, bird, fish.

3
00:00:16.368 --> 00:00:19.938
Fruit: apple, banana, orange.

4
00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:23.346
Colours: red, blue, green.

5
00:00:23.496 --> 00:00:28.674
Family: mother, father, sister, brother.

6
00:00:28.824 --> 00:00:32.034
For each word, ask: what is it?

7
00:00:32.184 --> 00:00:37.098
Odd one out: cat and dog are animals; apple is fruit.

8
00:00:37.248 --> 00:00:41.082
Body parts are a group too: eye, ear, hand.

9
00:00:41.232 --> 00:00:45.930
School things: pencil, ruler, book.

10
00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:50.610
Watch out! A banana is yellow, but it isn't a colour!

11
00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:53.346
Ask: what is a banana?

12
00:00:53.496 --> 00:00:58.146
A banana is a fruit, so it goes with fruit.

13
00:00:58.296 --> 00:01:07.770
Your turn! Lion, tiger, pear: which is the odd one out? Pause and think.

14
00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:14.010
Pear is a fruit; the others are animals. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:22.074
Another one! Which word is a colour? Pause and think.

16
00:01:22.224 --> 00:01:26.850
Pink is a colour. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:35.346
Here's another! Which word is a family member? Pause and think.

18
00:01:35.496 --> 00:01:40.266
Brother is family. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:40.416 --> 00:01:49.986
Try one more! Nose, mouth, chair: which is the odd one out? Pause and think.

20
00:01:50.136 --> 00:01:56.730
Chair is furniture; the others are body parts. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:56.880 --> 00:02:04.650
Try one more! Which is a school thing? Pause and think.

22
00:02:04.800 --> 00:02:09.978
A ruler is a school thing. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:10.128 --> 00:02:18.618
Try one more! Which group does mango belong to? Pause and think.

24
00:02:18.768 --> 00:02:23.538
Mango is a fruit. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:23.688 --> 00:02:32.970
Try one more! Red, blue, bread: which is the odd one out? Pause and think.

26
00:02:33.120 --> 00:02:39.066
Bread is food; the others are colours. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:39.216 --> 00:02:47.082
Last one! Which word is an animal? Pause and think.

28
00:02:47.232 --> 00:02:52.073
A duck is an animal. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:52.224 --> 00:02:57.953
Remember: ask what each thing is. The odd one out doesn't belong to the group.

30
00:02:58.103 --> 00:03:03.017
Name three animals and three fruits for your family!

